</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 2</span>: </span><span id="S5.F2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Pretraining dynamics for the experiment model. LM loss and gradient norm are shown for Full Attention and <span id="S5.F2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">MSA</span>-PT over 3T training tokens. The inset in (a) zooms in on the final 50B-token window, where the two LM-loss curves remain nearly overlapping.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S5.F3" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
